{
  "_comment": [
    "Hand-authored search terms, one entry per first-100-days action, used by",
    "audit_100_days.py to sweep the normas archive. These are NOT the bigram",
    "matcher — that one indexes the whole plan and answers 'which commitment does",
    "this norma resemble?'. These answer the opposite question, one promise at a",
    "time: 'has anything at all been published about this?'. Prefer the branded",
    "programme name (FEDETUR, Licencia 0, qochas) — if the programme were created,",
    "that string would appear verbatim in its creating norm. Patterns are regexes",
    "matched against accent-folded, lowercased 'tipo numero sumilla'.",
    "Deliberately loose: a false hit costs one line of reading, a false miss hides",
    "a kept promise. Every .C id in the plan must appear here — the audit fails if",
    "one is missing, so a regenerated plan cannot silently drop coverage."
  ],
